stateDiagram-v2
    %% A ticket in the tracker's working status, walked to a QA handoff.
    %% Dashed states wait on a reviewer; bold ones on the person whose ticket
    %% it is. ESCALATED goes back to where the escalation stopped the work.
    classDef waiting stroke-dasharray: 4 4
    classDef attention stroke-width:3px

    [*] --> DISCOVERED
    DISCOVERED --> CLARIFYING: it leaves questions open
    DISCOVERED --> READY: it can be done as written
    CLARIFYING --> READY: the question was answered
    READY --> IMPLEMENTING
    IMPLEMENTING --> CHECKED: the agent finished
    CHECKED --> IMPLEMENTING: the gate is red
    CHECKED --> SELF_REVIEW: the gate is green
    SELF_REVIEW --> PR_OPEN
    PR_OPEN --> COPILOT_WAIT: the pull request exists
    COPILOT_WAIT --> COPILOT_FIX: open automated threads
    COPILOT_FIX --> COPILOT_WAIT: every thread judged
    COPILOT_WAIT --> REVIEWER_ASSIGNED: nothing automated outstanding
    REVIEWER_ASSIGNED --> HUMAN_REVIEW: a reviewer was asked
    HUMAN_REVIEW --> HUMAN_FIX: open threads
    HUMAN_FIX --> ESCALATED: too large, or a comment needs the owner
    HUMAN_FIX --> RE_REVIEW: every comment addressed
    HUMAN_REVIEW --> RE_REVIEW: every thread judged
    RE_REVIEW --> HUMAN_REVIEW: asked to look again
    RE_REVIEW --> REVIEWER_ASSIGNED: no reviewer recorded
    HUMAN_REVIEW --> REVIEWER_ASSIGNED: no reviewer recorded
    HUMAN_REVIEW --> APPROVED
    APPROVED --> QA_HANDOFF
    QA_HANDOFF --> DONE

    IMPLEMENTING --> ESCALATED: the agent failed every attempt
    CHECKED --> ESCALATED: the gate stayed red
    COPILOT_FIX --> ESCALATED: too large for an agent
    REVIEWER_ASSIGNED --> ESCALATED: the forge says the branch is broken

    COPILOT_WAIT --> PR_OPEN: no pull request
    COPILOT_FIX --> PR_OPEN: no pull request
    REVIEWER_ASSIGNED --> PR_OPEN: no pull request
    HUMAN_REVIEW --> PR_OPEN: no pull request
    HUMAN_FIX --> PR_OPEN: no pull request

    DONE --> [*]

    note right of ESCALATED: returns to the state it was escalated from
    class COPILOT_WAIT,HUMAN_REVIEW waiting
    class CLARIFYING,ESCALATED attention
    class ESCALATED returns
